  ARCHIVAL_NOTICE.md; use v1.1.0 for new data collection.
title: >-
  BahriApp: An Android Platform for Gamified Multimodal Behavioural-Biometric
  Data Acquisition with Native Amharic (Ge'ez) Keystroke Support
